# ファイル変換 and a BTRON CD-ROM on the x64 PC (tools/x64/ui_run64.py --cdrom IMAGE): tools/tests/ui_btcd.steps
# with the q35 machine: ファイル変換 started by opening its program object (the 小物 menu of
# the x64 image lists other programs, so its place there differs), and the drive uda after
# nvmea, nvmea0, nvmea1 and nvmea2 (/tslog) in its list, at 200,271; the rest as there.
# ファイル変換 and a BTRON CD-ROM (design 11.9), for tools/ui_run.py with
# --cdrom obj/_QEMU_VIRT__ktest<id>/btcd.iso (tools/tests/mkbtcd.py):
# the drive listed as uda with the name of its file system, opened as a
# window of the 実身 its root links to; 資料 gone into and back; はじめに
# carried into the BTRON window, made 実身 with the figure it links to; the
# ISO 9660 side's folder after the 実身 gone into and back;
# 図１ taken in with Ctrl+I into a new box, and opened.
dclick 80 141
wait 1500
open 01a0d8c4-52b1-7c21-9a31-4f5e6d7c8b91
expect xfconv: ready
expect xfconv: media uda 2,514,944 バイト - btron 試験CD
wait 500
win ファイル変換
shot btcd_media
dclick 200 271
expect xfconv: btron 試験CD cdrom block 2048 semi-standard extended
expect xfconv: dir uda 7 entries
expect xfconv: iso uda 2 entries
wait 800
win 試験CD
shot btcd_root
# 資料 gone into: the link file to another file system is left out
dclick 260 279
expect xfconv: dir uda/資料 4 entries
wait 500
shot btcd_docs
key 2a
expect xfconv: dir uda 7 entries
wait 300
# the ISO 9660 side after the 実身: the files beside the partition by their Joliet names
dclick 260 407
expect xfconv: dir uda/ISO 9660 2 entries
wait 500
shot btcd_iso
key 2a
expect xfconv: dir uda 7 entries
wait 300
# はじめに carried into the BTRON window: no panel, made 実身 with 図１, linked where let go
hold 260 215
wait 300
move 150 200
wait 100
move 60 200
wait 300
up
expect xfconv: carried 1 into
expect xfconv: btron import はじめに 0 objects 2
expect xfconv: placed 1 links
wait 800
shot btcd_placed
# 図１ chosen and taken in with Ctrl+I: a new box the desktop opens
win 試験CD
click 260 247
expect xfconv: selected 1: 図1
key 0c 1
expect xfconv: imported 1 of 1 objects 2 box
wait 1500
shot btcd_box
# 図１ opened: 基本図形編集 shows its two rectangles and its 仮身 to はじめに
dclick 300 200
wait 2500
shot btcd_figure
# its 仮身 opened: はじめに in 基本文章編集, its text and its 仮身 back to 図１
dclick 150 280
wait 2500
shot btcd_text
